# VERVEAI — Intelligent Offline-First Diagnostic Assessment Engine

## Project Overview
- **Name:** VERVEAI
- **Type:** Next.js web portal (ưu tiên CAO NHẤT) + Microservice backend + Flutter/Dart app (ưu tiên sau)
- **Phiên bản BA:** v1.4.5 (Phụ lục F & G).
- **Architecture:** web-portal/ + service/ (microservice backend) + app/ + content-pipeline/ + research/.
- **Stack:** Next.js/TypeScript/Tailwind CSS (web-portal), Node.js/TypeScript (microservice backend), Flutter/Dart (app).

## Ưu tiên phát triển

| Ưu tiên | Module | Mô tả |
|----------|--------|--------|
| **CAO NHẤT** | `web-portal/` | Next.js/TypeScript — web portal cho giáo viên |
| **CAO** | `service/` | Node.js/TypeScript Microservices — 5 service + Gateway |
| Sau | `app/` | Flutter/Dart — PWA offline |

### web-portal/ (Next.js)
- **Mục đích:** Web portal cho giáo viên (dashboard, quản lý lớp, theo dõi tiến độ)
- **Stack:** Next.js ≥ 14, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS v3, React 18
- **Triển khai:** Vercel / static hosting
- **Cấu trúc:** Next.js App Router (`src/app/`)
- **Kết nối backend:** Web portal chỉ gọi qua Gateway (`http://gateway:8080/api/...`)

### service/ (Node.js Microservices) — Phase 2 ⭐

> **Tham chiếu:** [`service/WORK_SPLIT.md`](../../service/WORK_SPLIT.md) — Phân chia 5 microservice.

| Service | Port | Owner | Trách nhiệm |
|---------|------|-------|-------------|
| `service/service-auth/` | **3001** | Dev 1 | Authentication, Users, JWT |
| `service/service-bkt/` | **3002** | Dev 2 | BKT engine, Diagnosis, Evidence, Interventions, Skills |
| `service/service-class/` | **3003** | Dev 3 | Classes, Students, Progress |
| `service/service-content/` | **3004** | Dev 1 | Content, Bundles (Ed25519), Review, Reports |
| `service/service-sync/` | **3005** | Dev 3 | Sync, Devices, Conflict resolution |
| `gateway/` | **8080** | Dev Lead | Express Gateway — JWT verify, rate limit, routing |

**Stack (Node.js "Spring Cloud"-style):**
- Node.js ≥ 20, TypeScript ≥ 5.0 strict, Express
- **Prisma ORM** — shared PostgreSQL, 5 schema (auth, bkt, class, content, sync)
- **Consul** — Service Discovery + health check (port 8500)
- **opossum** — Circuit Breaker cho inter-service call
- **OpenTelemetry** + **Jaeger** — Distributed tracing (port 16686)
- **Prometheus** + **Grafana** — Metrics (port 9090 / 3000)
- **Zod** — Validation; **Winston** — Logging
- **Helmet**, **cors**, **express-rate-limit**

### app/ (Flutter) — ưu tiên sau
- **Mục đích:** App học sinh + giáo viên offline 100%
- **Stack:** Flutter ≥ 3.22, Dart ≥ 3.4, SQLite, llama.cpp via FFI
- **Nền tảng:** Android (APK) + Windows (EXE)
- **Kết nối backend:** Hub cục bộ (SC-05) → microservice gateway

